        "title": "Title of the patch"
      },
      {
        "category": "description",
        "text": "This update for wpa_supplicant fixes the following issues\n\n- CVE-2025-24912: hostapd RADIUS authentication of wi-fi devices allows a user in between the hostapd and the RADIUS\n  server to inject crafted RADIUS packets and force RADIUS authentications to fail (bsc#1239461).\n- Missing network context validation for PMKSA caching https://w1.fi/security/2026-2/.\n",
        "title": "Description of the patch"
      },
